# jkbase CLI release-signing keys: the trust root for `jkbase upgrade`, sites/www/install.sh and
# sites/www/install.ps1 (which embed a copy; jkbase-cli's tests fail if they drift). ssh-keygen
# allowed_signers format, one Ed25519 key per line, every line exactly:
#   jkbase-release namespaces="jkbase-cli-release" ssh-ed25519 <base64> <comment>
# A release verifies if ANY listed key signed its SHA256SUMS. Rotation: docs/cli-release-signing.md.
